SET UTF-8

NAME Diŧionario de lengua vèneta
VERSION 7.0.1 (2025/11/28)
HOME http://parnodexmentegar.orgfree.com/
LANG vec-IT


TRY eaoinrtlƚsdkpvmuèxgfàòbíhéŧójɉñcúSđLȽIPETKVAMDNFBRJGCOUĐXÀÈŦHɈÒÑÍÉÓÚʼïÏüÜ-–

# the complete alphabet is: aàbcdđeéèfghiïíjɉklƚmnñoóòprstŧuüúvx


# account for qwerty, hungarian, slovenian, brazilian, and romanian layout
KEY aà|eéè|iíï|oóò|uúü|ae|uo|iíïeè|gnñ|mn|tŧ|rl|pbv|jđ|ŧfh|cɉ|guv|esdđr|redđftŧ|tŧrfg|uhjɉi|iujɉko|oiklƚp|polƚòèé-|èépòà|úó|aísđ|saxdđe|dđsxcfre|fdđcvgtŧr|gfvbhtŧ|hgbnñjɉu|jɉhnñmkiu|kjɉmlƚoi|lƚkéòpo|ñlƚp-|òlƚàèép-|àòèé-|ùà|élƚp-|xcsdđ|cxvfdđ|vcbgf|bvnñhg|nñbmjɉh|mnñkjɉ|ìèé

WORDCHARS ʼ-–

BREAK 0

# affix rules can strip full words, not only one less characters
FULLSTRIP

# suggest the right forms for words which incorrectly choose the wrong letter from a related set more than once in a word
MAP 12
MAP aà
MAP eèé
MAP iïí
MAP oòó
MAP uüú
MAP dđ
MAP AÀ
MAP EÈÉ
MAP IÏÍ
MAP OÒÓ
MAP UÜÚ
MAP DĐ

# replace input characters
ICONV 33
ICONV ' ʼ
ICONV ‘ ʼ
ICONV ’ ʼ
ICONV ᾽ ʼ
ICONV ＇ ʼ
ICONV ˈ ʼ
ICONV ì í
ICONV Ì Í
ICONV ù ú
ICONV Ù Ú
ICONV dh đ
ICONV Dh Đ
ICONV DH Đ
ICONV fh f
ICONV Fh F
ICONV FH F
ICONV ꞙ f
ICONV Ꞙ F
ICONV jh ɉ
ICONV Jh Ɉ
ICONV JH Ɉ
ICONV lh ƚ
ICONV Lh Ƚ
ICONV LH Ƚ
ICONV gn ñ
ICONV Gn Ñ
ICONV GN Ñ
ICONV nh ñ
ICONV Nh Ñ
ICONV NH Ñ
ICONV th ŧ
ICONV Th Ŧ
ICONV TH Ŧ

OCONV 2
OCONV ñ gn
OCONV Ñ GN

# frequently switched character groups
REP 121
REP ʼ ʼ_
REP - ‒
REP - –
REP - -
REP – ‒
REP – -
REP ‒ -
REP ‒ –
REP a à
REP e è
REP e é
REP è é
REP i í
REP i ï
REP o ò
REP o ó
REP ò ó
REP u ú
REP u ü
REP d đ
REP s x
REP x s
REP mb nb
REP mf nf
REP mp np
